@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
participant "Sender" as A
participant "Partition leader" as L
participant "Messages" as S
participant "Log" as K
participant "New app" as N
participant "Old app" as O
participant "Search" as Q
A -> L : SEND {kind: EDIT, target: 1234, body}
L -> L : check: the sender wrote 1234,\nand it's inside the edit window
L -> S : one Raft entry: row at seq 1250 (EDIT)\n+ update row 1234 (body, edited_at)
L --> A : ACK {seq: 1250}
S -> K : MessageStored {seq 1250, kind EDIT}
K -> N : MSG 1250: replace the text of 1234
K -> O : MSG 1250: unknown kind, skip
O -> O : cursor = 1250, not stuck;\nstill shows the original
K -> Q : reindex 1234
note over N, O : A device that syncs later reads row 1234 already edited, then 1250.\nApplying 1250 again changes nothing, so the order of the two doesn't matter.
@enduml
